sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Requester
  participant O as Order Service
  participant Cr as Credit Service
  participant P as Pub/Sub

  R->>O: Create errand
  Note over O: #nbsp;#nbsp;Record the command durably#nbsp;#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;#nbsp;("may have a Credit effect")#nbsp;#nbsp;
  O-xCr: Reserve credits
  Note over O,Cr: #nbsp;#nbsp;Timeout or Credit down:#nbsp;#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;#nbsp;did the reservation happen?#nbsp;#nbsp;
  Note over O: #nbsp;#nbsp;Outcome uncertain:#nbsp;#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;#nbsp;queue a compensation command (outbox)#nbsp;#nbsp;
  O-->>R: 202 Pending: "We are reversing or fencing the Credit request"
  O-)P: credit-command-compensation (re-published every 30 s until a result)
  P-)Cr: Push (retried until Credit is back, then dead-letter)
  Note over Cr: #nbsp;#nbsp;Reverse the reservation if it happened,#nbsp;#nbsp;<br/>#nbsp;#nbsp;or fence the command so a late copy is ignored#nbsp;#nbsp;
  Cr-)P: credit-command-compensation-result
  P-)O: Push result
  Note over O: #nbsp;#nbsp;Close the request as REJECTED (compensated)#nbsp;#nbsp;
  R->>O: Poll the request (UI, every 5 s)
  O-->>R: "Request did not complete: Credit confirmed reversal or fencing"
